**Potential Logic Error: Missing Handler for INVITE_TO_SUBMIT_EXPENSE Resolution**

The `resolveActionableMentionWhisper` function no longer handles the `CONST.REPORT.ACTIONABLE_MENTION_WHISPER_RESOLUTION.INVITE_TO_SUBMIT_EXPENSE` case, but this resolution type is still used in `PureReportActionItem.tsx` (lines 907-916). 

When users select the "Invite to Submit Expense" option from the actionable mention whisper UI, the function will now only update the message resolution without actually inviting users to the workspace.

**Suggested Fix:**
Either:
1. Add handling logic for this case, or 
2. Remove the `INVITE_TO_SUBMIT_EXPENSE` option from the UI in `PureReportActionItem.tsx` if this functionality is no longer needed

```typescript
if (resolution === CONST.REPORT.ACTIONABLE_MENTION_WHISPER_RESOLUTION.INVITE_TO_SUBMIT_EXPENSE) {
    // Add appropriate handling or explicitly document why this case is intentionally unhandled
    console.warn('INVITE_TO_SUBMIT_EXPENSE resolution is no longer supported');
    return;
}
```
